{"4610360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Billion Egg Farm", "steam_appid": 4610360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billion Egg Farm is a first-person automation game where you put chickens to work laying eggs and build production lines for eggs, meat, and processed goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place conveyors, build structures, and create the chicken farm of your dreams. Just keep in mind — your products are driven by physics, so things won't always go according to plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, enemies will attack both you and your farm, and your goal is to survive while earning 1 billion G.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Based Automation </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use conveyors to fully automate the path from egg to shipment — including meat and processed goods. But everything on the line moves with real physics, which means products can get jammed, pile up, or crack from a hard impact. Design your lines carefully to keep things running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/90faddb0cff5aeaeef72ec2ded27555b.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/90faddb0cff5aeaeef72ec2ded27555b.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/90faddb0cff5aeaeef72ec2ded27555b.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Anything </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack blocks, place fences, and construct factories, barns, houses — whatever you need. A grid-based building system lets you shape your very own chicken farm from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/bb72a8c721c1f75c26ef8e7039188ee3.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/bb72a8c721c1f75c26ef8e7039188ee3.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/bb72a8c721c1f75c26ef8e7039188ee3.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Over 30 Chicken Breeds </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 unique breeds, each with a distinct look and egg type. Every breed lays eggs with different appearances and values. Find your favorites and build the most profitable egg line you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/0b8b48429bdadf750162755751d22856.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/0b8b48429bdadf750162755751d22856.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/0b8b48429bdadf750162755751d22856.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handy Tools for Better Efficiency</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacuum up eggs for bulk collection, pull scattered eggs toward you. When your farm is producing more than you can handle by hand, the right tools make all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/ef7ea68da8e3a34f142d1da6049d3768.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/ef7ea68da8e3a34f142d1da6049d3768.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/ef7ea68da8e3a34f142d1da6049d3768.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crossbreed Your Chickens </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair specific chickens together to produce entirely new egg types. Discover the right combinations and create breeds that lay rarer, more valuable eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/d63b2e4f4ef9ff584d163ec0a1f4a40b.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/d63b2e4f4ef9ff584d163ec0a1f4a40b.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/d63b2e4f4ef9ff584d163ec0a1f4a40b.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eggs or Meat — Your Call </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickens aren't just for laying eggs. Grab a knife, and you can turn any chicken into meat for shipping. Eggs or meat — the business decision is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/a620fe1751e70537f071d3d2e53d535c.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/a620fe1751e70537f071d3d2e53d535c.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/a620fe1751e70537f071d3d2e53d535c.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Night Raids </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, enemies come for you. Ignore them and they'll multiply, eventually destroying your precious farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/1f9a65c09b93c2dec8189d6536eec98e.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/1f9a65c09b93c2dec8189d6536eec98e.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/1f9a65c09b93c2dec8189d6536eec98e.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Billion Egg Farm is a first-person automation game where you put chickens to work laying eggs and build production lines for eggs, meat, and processed goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place conveyors, build structures, and create the chicken farm of your dreams. Just keep in mind — your products are driven by physics, so things won't always go according to plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, enemies will attack both you and your farm, and your goal is to survive while earning 1 billion G.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physics-Based Automation </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use conveyors to fully automate the path from egg to shipment — including meat and processed goods. But everything on the line moves with real physics, which means products can get jammed, pile up, or crack from a hard impact. Design your lines carefully to keep things running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/90faddb0cff5aeaeef72ec2ded27555b.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/90faddb0cff5aeaeef72ec2ded27555b.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/90faddb0cff5aeaeef72ec2ded27555b.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Anything </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack blocks, place fences, and construct factories, barns, houses — whatever you need. A grid-based building system lets you shape your very own chicken farm from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/bb72a8c721c1f75c26ef8e7039188ee3.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/bb72a8c721c1f75c26ef8e7039188ee3.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/bb72a8c721c1f75c26ef8e7039188ee3.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Over 30 Chicken Breeds </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 30 unique breeds, each with a distinct look and egg type. Every breed lays eggs with different appearances and values. Find your favorites and build the most profitable egg line you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/0b8b48429bdadf750162755751d22856.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/0b8b48429bdadf750162755751d22856.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/0b8b48429bdadf750162755751d22856.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handy Tools for Better Efficiency</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacuum up eggs for bulk collection, pull scattered eggs toward you. When your farm is producing more than you can handle by hand, the right tools make all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/ef7ea68da8e3a34f142d1da6049d3768.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/ef7ea68da8e3a34f142d1da6049d3768.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/ef7ea68da8e3a34f142d1da6049d3768.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crossbreed Your Chickens </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair specific chickens together to produce entirely new egg types. Discover the right combinations and create breeds that lay rarer, more valuable eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/d63b2e4f4ef9ff584d163ec0a1f4a40b.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/d63b2e4f4ef9ff584d163ec0a1f4a40b.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/d63b2e4f4ef9ff584d163ec0a1f4a40b.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eggs or Meat — Your Call </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickens aren't just for laying eggs. Grab a knife, and you can turn any chicken into meat for shipping. Eggs or meat — the business decision is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/a620fe1751e70537f071d3d2e53d535c.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/a620fe1751e70537f071d3d2e53d535c.webm?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/a620fe1751e70537f071d3d2e53d535c.mp4?t=1788343221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Night Raids </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, enemies come for you. Ignore them and they'll multiply, eventually destroying your precious farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4610360/extras/1f9a65c09b93c2dec8189d6536eec98e.poster.avif?t=1788343221\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass